<right ref="RM000002T0P003X_04_0015" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002T0P003X_04_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___000068K00000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C161466J02" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the battery negative terminal and wait for 90 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the connector to the airbag computer assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Interchange the front airbag sensor RH with the front airbag sensor LH, connect the connectors and install them securely.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When installing, do not subject the front airbag sensor RH and front airbag sensor LH to strong impacts such as dropping them. </ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If a sensor has been subjected to a strong impact such as being dropped, replace it with a new one. </ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the battery negative terminal, turn IG ON and wait for 60 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002T0P003X_04_0007" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
